WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Stand in Mountain with feet hip-width.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Reach both arms overhead and hold the left wrist.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Tip to the right, lengthening the left side.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Keep both feet grounded and chest open.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold, then switch sides.
